Scripture — games/trial-of-job/
-------------------------------
Quoted verbatim from the World English Bible (WEB), which is in the public
domain. Every quotation is cited with chapter and verse.

The `lang.simple.json` retelling is a PARAPHRASE, not a translation, and is
deliberately never given a chapter-and-verse citation — its passages are
attributed as "from the story of Job" so that wording written for this project
is never presented as scripture.
